# The sixth change is refused

Tybalt sends:
	<iq type="set" id="change6" to="localhost">
		<command xmlns="http://jabber.org/protocol/commands" node="recovery-email" action="execute">
			<x xmlns="jabber:x:data" type="submit">
				<field var="email"><value>tybalt6@example.org</value></field>
			</x>
		</command>
	</iq>

Tybalt receives:
	<iq type="result" id="change6" from="localhost">
		<command xmlns="http://jabber.org/protocol/commands" node="recovery-email" status="completed" sessionid="{scansion:any}">
			<note type="error">Too many changes. Please try again later.</note>
		</command>
	</iq>

Tybalt disconnects
